# Metaplex program images for the Exclusive Lootbox NFT Surfpool journey, verified
# by `fetch:metaplex-programs`. A line with a third column downloads that URL;
# the others are dumped from mainnet with `solana program dump`.
# Bubblegum: the public release asset of release/bubblegum@2.0.0
# (79e1a1954bddb7fe5dcd52a5570a66a9f7d465e4). The OtterSec-verified mainnet
# image of that commit (b3a04a9d…, dumped 2026-09-26) was replaced on
# 2026-10-30. That upgrade's verify attestation names
# github.com/metaplex-foundation/security-mpl-bubblegum e756c86c22ce5252…,
# which is not a public repository. Pin the published 2.0.0 asset until that
# source is public and reviewed, the same way Core stays on its release asset.
# MPL Account Compression and MPL Noop: 2025-05-13 deploys, dumped 2026-09-26.
# Core: release/core@0.15.3 (8c5cee35199a7d103e181de7b13f2e20b1e20103), the
# release asset. With trailing zeros stripped it hashes to 1b0151ff…5d0a4, the
# build OtterSec reproduced from the tag. It was live on mainnet from 2026-10-07
# to 2026-10-09, when Metaplex upgraded Core from a private, unverified source.
# Re-pin to mainnet once that source is public and OtterSec-verified.
# The binaries are fetched at test time and never committed.
